  "conditions" : "Three actual app JVMs share one owned MySQL/Redis; equal-byte distinct namespaces; only command-line TTL differs. All writes complete before reads, each tick rotates TTL order, HTTP requests are sequential. Scenario windows start empty after ten unmeasured warmup reads per JVM; no deletion/TTL refresh during a measurement window.",
  "limitations" : [ "One local run per scenario, synthetic traffic and dataset; not a production optimum or concurrency/load capacity claim.", "All three TTLs share DB/Redis and OS resources; sequential order is rotated, not a randomized independent experiment.", "HTTP timing excludes parent assertions, child diagnostic capture, memory probes and JSON report writes; their scheduling lag is recorded.", "Actual offered rate can be lower than plan if sequential observer overhead overruns a tick; report actual duration and delays.", "JDBC execute timing excludes ResultSet consumption. Application/filter/JDBC observer overhead remains.", "Redis per-key MEMORY USAGE is allocation, STRLEN is payload, INFO memory is whole shared Redis process; RSS need not shrink after expiry.", "Memory snapshots use SCAN and are not atomic peaks. Expired keys may disappear while being observed.", "Hit ratio is per HTTP request; an ordinary miss has two Redis lookups because single-flight rechecks.", "Warmup errors are retained outside measurements. Measured errors are preserved and fail the experiment without retry.", "No application warmup feature, production TTL change, transaction/lock change, shared key deletion or shared volume deletion." ],
  "sqlTemplates" : {
    "14004123a9accd71" : "select u1_0.id,u1_0.point_balance,u1_0.created_at,u1_0.updated_at from user u1_0 where u1_0.id=? for update",
    "3b4ef4f8fdfe3977" : "select p1_0.id,p1_0.brand_id,p1_0.created_at,p1_0.deleted_at,p1_0.name,p1_0.price,p1_0.stock_quantity,p1_0.updated_at from product p1_0 where p1_0.id=? for update",
    "8f2885a248343645" : "select pl1_0.id from `like` pl1_0 join user u1_0 on u1_0.id=pl1_0.user_id join product p1_0 on p1_0.id=pl1_0.product_id where u1_0.id=? and p1_0.id=? limit ?",
    "0d40cf9d6368f1d5" : "select b1_0.id,b1_0.created_at,b1_0.deleted_at,b1_0.name,b1_0.updated_at from brand b1_0 where b1_0.id=?",
    "4cd762061edd7d08" : "delete pl1_0 from `like` pl1_0 where pl1_0.user_id=? and pl1_0.product_id=?",
